(183089, 10491, 2, '<td valign="top">This picture is great!  Add this to my list of ''I want that in my kitchen'' photographs.  I think it''d be more effective as a less rectangular shot, though ... as I almost feel like I''ve got to <i>pan</i> the picture to see everything that''s going on.  Great job, though.</td>', 'This picture is great!  Add this to my list of ''I want that in my kitchen'' photographs.  I think it''d be more effective as a less rectangular shot, though ... as I almost feel like I''ve got to pan the picture to see everything that''s going on.  Great job, though.', '2003-01-06 00:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
