(183617, 10459, 4648, '<td valign="top">You went all the way around the world and pole to get this one.  Not really sure it fits the challenge, but I''ll sure give you credit for stretching your brain to come up with this.  I mean, it is a really good, technically right on photo.  But it''s like you took the photo and then tried to fit it into the challenge.  Photo = 10; Stretching brain to fit challenge = 10;  fitting challenge = 0;  average = 6.6.  Since I can''t give less than a point I have to round it back to a 6 because it REALLY DOESN"T FIT THE CHALLENGE.  But I''ve enjoyed it.  PTL</td>', 'You went all the way around the world and pole to get this one.  Not really sure it fits the challenge, but I''ll sure give you credit for stretching your brain to come up with this.  I mean, it is a really good, technically right on photo.  But it''s like you took the photo and then tried to fit it into the challenge.  Photo = 10; Stretching brain to fit challenge = 10;  fitting challenge = 0;  average = 6.6.  Since I can''t give less than a point I have to round it back to a 6 because it REALLY DOESN"T FIT THE CHALLENGE.  But I''ve enjoyed it.  PTL', '2003-01-06 10:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(183618, 10574, 2363, '<td valign="top">Love the yellow background. Perhaps a tad over-sharpened - the lettering on the bottle gets rather pixelly towards the bottom.</td>', 'Love the yellow background. Perhaps a tad over-sharpened - the lettering on the bottle gets rather pixelly towards the bottom.', '2003-01-06 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(183628, 10593, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great fantastic idea.  But all of it needs to be in sharp focus.  The roll of film is what is in the strange land of digital, therefor it is what need to be in focus.  With the way you have it it appears, to me anyway, that digital is strange and the world is the roll of film.  Think about it a minute.  I could be wrong.  But I really do love the unique idea.  Your idea is a 10, the photo quality is only a 4 at the most, more like a 3.  That would be an average of 6 - 7, which is actually more than the photo itself should get on it''s merits.  But this is just how I see it.  Has good potential with just a little change.  PTL.  Could be a 10 overall.</td>', 'Great fantastic idea.  But all of it needs to be in sharp focus.  The roll of film is what is in the strange land of digital, therefor it is what need to be in focus.  With the way you have it it appears, to me anyway, that digital is strange and the world is the roll of film.  Think about it a minute.  I could be wrong.  But I really do love the unique idea.  Your idea is a 10, the photo quality is only a 4 at the most, more like a 3.  That would be an average of 6 - 7, which is actually more than the photo itself should get on it''s merits.  But this is just how I see it.  Has good potential with just a little change.  PTL.  Could be a 10 overall.', '2003-01-06 10:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(183637, 10686, 2363, '<td valign="top">Rather overexposed (the label on the litter tray and the dog''s collar are blown out) Slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Rather overexposed (the label on the litter tray and the dog''s collar are blown out) Slightly out of focus.', '2003-01-06 11:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(183638, 10603, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love it.  And you already know it''s a right on photograph, interest wi..  Only problem is it''s a little dark on the left side and the shadows are very distracting.  Lighting from the sides might have taken care of that then still use the flash.  Just a thought.  and still a good shot worth a 6 to me.  PTL</td>', 'I love it.  And you already know it''s a right on photograph, interest wi..  Only problem is it''s a little dark on the left side and the shadows are very distracting.  Lighting from the sides might have taken care of that then still use the flash.  Just a thought.  and still a good shot worth a 6 to me.  PTL', '2003-01-06 11:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(183640, 10402, 4648, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to get this one.  I think sepia helped you here, because the candles don''t show up too well in B&amp;W.  They''re too grainy as it is.  It''s a little dark, but you probably did that intentionally.  I''d give it between a 5 and a 6.  PTL</td>', 'Took me a minute to get this one.  I think sepia helped you here, because the candles don''t show up too well in B&W.  They''re too grainy as it is.  It''s a little dark, but you probably did that intentionally.  I''d give it between a 5 and a 6.  PTL', '2003-01-06 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
