(183914, 10425, 4493, '<td valign="top">Strange indeed! Colors, texture and light all make for an interesting shot.</td>', 'Strange indeed! Colors, texture and light all make for an interesting shot.', '2003-01-06 14:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(183918, 10430, 1005, '<td valign="top">Got me!  What is it?  Wild references in the title.  7 Swash</td>', 'Got me!  What is it?  Wild references in the title.  7 Swash', '2003-01-06 14:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(183923, 10650, 4967, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m supposed to be looking at here which is bothersome, also the lighting could have been much better.  To me this photo is not appealing composition wise, or anything else.  There are a few major problems here, I''m just trying to let you know for next time.  First of all the lines lead your eyes everywhere but to your subject, must of them lead right off the page.  Also it looks like you attempted to light the subject, to draw attention to it, but everything else detracts from it.  The cropping is not overall appealing here, and I don''t care for the colors either.  I would have suggested using possibly a bright colored subject to go where that brown thing is, because he is too dull against the background.  My eyes are drawn more to the pink birdhourse and pink thing above it, and the bright colored snake then anything else.  I don''t think you achieved what you were going for which is a shame cause it might have been very interesting.  A different angle might have helped, but I''m not sure what other suggestions to make.  I hope this short critique helps...</td>', 'Not sure what I''m supposed to be looking at here which is bothersome, also the lighting could have been much better.  To me this photo is not appealing composition wise, or anything else.  There are a few major problems here, I''m just trying to let you know for next time.  First of all the lines lead your eyes everywhere but to your subject, must of them lead right off the page.  Also it looks like you attempted to light the subject, to draw attention to it, but everything else detracts from it.  The cropping is not overall appealing here, and I don''t care for the colors either.  I would have suggested using possibly a bright colored subject to go where that brown thing is, because he is too dull against the background.  My eyes are drawn more to the pink birdhourse and pink thing above it, and the bright colored snake then anything else.  I don''t think you achieved what you were going for which is a shame cause it might have been very interesting.  A different angle might have helped, but I''m not sure what other suggestions to make.  I hope this short critique helps...', '2003-01-06 14:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(183927, 10662, 4967, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get this when I saw it as a thumbnail... now looking at it, I see the diamond in the.. apple... hehehehe?  GREAT idea, very appropriate for the challenge, and I love the title.  The picture isn''t maybe as appealing as it could be, I don''t care for the white bottom or the lighting but it''s a great idea, and I love your use of DOF.  Nice job... -7-</td>', 'I didn''t get this when I saw it as a thumbnail... now looking at it, I see the diamond in the.. apple... hehehehe?  GREAT idea, very appropriate for the challenge, and I love the title.  The picture isn''t maybe as appealing as it could be, I don''t care for the white bottom or the lighting but it''s a great idea, and I love your use of DOF.  Nice job... -7-', '2003-01-06 14:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(183928, 10545, 4967, '<td valign="top">Cool... didn''t know a tissue box would float like that!  Nice use of blues... very pretty, the lighting is a little bothersome, on the left side... kind of takes your eye away from the subject, but I love the shadow here, and this is a cool idea!  -8-</td>', 'Cool... didn''t know a tissue box would float like that!  Nice use of blues... very pretty, the lighting is a little bothersome, on the left side... kind of takes your eye away from the subject, but I love the shadow here, and this is a cool idea!  -8-', '2003-01-06 15:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(183929, 10533, 4967, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the challenge.  Definitely a stranger literally in strange land :-)  Not an extremely appealing photo visually, but cute all the same.  Good choice of using a plain background, and I like the fact that it''s blue.  Also not bad lighting.  -7-</td>', 'Excellent use of the challenge.  Definitely a stranger literally in strange land :-)  Not an extremely appealing photo visually, but cute all the same.  Good choice of using a plain background, and I like the fact that it''s blue.  Also not bad lighting.  -7-', '2003-01-06 15:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(183931, 10627, 4967, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha... now this is a very funny one.  Thanks for the laugh!  Overall not a bad picture, especially good job with the lighting, which can be extremely tough in an indoor situation like this.  Nice job with that.  It definitely gets the point across as well.</td>', 'Hahahaha... now this is a very funny one.  Thanks for the laugh!  Overall not a bad picture, especially good job with the lighting, which can be extremely tough in an indoor situation like this.  Nice job with that.  It definitely gets the point across as well.', '2003-01-06 15:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(183932, 10632, 5369, '<td valign="top">Adorable!! Looking out at all the new wonders in this strange place.</td>', 'Adorable!! Looking out at all the new wonders in this strange place.', '2003-01-06 15:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(184009, 10545, 4430, '<td valign="top">This is so funny. In my "I don''t know anything so I should just shut up" opinion I think this would have been better without the glare, (sunlight?) on the left.  I really like the colors and just can''t stop looking at this.</td>', 'This is so funny. In my "I don''t know anything so I should just shut up" opinion I think this would have been better without the glare, (sunlight?) on the left.  I really like the colors and just can''t stop looking at this.', '2003-01-06 16:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(184016, 10497, 4430, '<td valign="top">brilliant colors, great capture.  Did you crop out the end of the tail or did it get cut off?</td>', 'brilliant colors, great capture.  Did you crop out the end of the tail or did it get cut off?', '2003-01-06 16:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(184018, 10614, 4430, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I understand the crop, long building, long crop.  I think however, that I would have left some more grass and sky to give it more balance. Just my opinion though.</td>', 'Great photo.  I understand the crop, long building, long crop.  I think however, that I would have left some more grass and sky to give it more balance. Just my opinion though.', '2003-01-06 16:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(184020, 10528, 4430, '<td valign="top">Hey! I think that everytime I find some in my purse!</td>', 'Hey! I think that everytime I find some in my purse!', '2003-01-06 16:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(184022, 10658, 4430, '<td valign="top">I gotta tell you this gives me the creeps!  Does that say Bob Villa? This pic sorta seems unbalanced to me though.</td>', 'I gotta tell you this gives me the creeps!  Does that say Bob Villa? This pic sorta seems unbalanced to me though.', '2003-01-06 17:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(184024, 10670, 4430, '<td valign="top">nice colors, nice crop. Great idea.  Makes me a bit dizzy.</td>', 'nice colors, nice crop. Great idea.  Makes me a bit dizzy.', '2003-01-06 17:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(184025, 10616, 4430, '<td valign="top">great mood in this.  I like color choice, not sure about angle though, or maybe too closely cropped to the corner.</td>', 'great mood in this.  I like color choice, not sure about angle though, or maybe too closely cropped to the corner.', '2003-01-06 17:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
