(184181, 10632, 1005, '<td valign="top">John, this is a wonderful photo, very clear, well taken and framed, but I just don''t see the connection to the challenge.  What''s strange?  6 Swash</td>', 'John, this is a wonderful photo, very clear, well taken and framed, but I just don''t see the connection to the challenge.  What''s strange?  6 Swash', '2003-01-06 18:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
