(184193, 10507, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I am lost as to the challenge aspect.  It''s cold outside and he is fully dressed for it.  The dogs look pretty natural too.  ??????  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo, but I am lost as to the challenge aspect.  It''s cold outside and he is fully dressed for it.  The dogs look pretty natural too.  ??????  6 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
