(184196, 10584, 1005, '<td valign="top">I finally figured out what this is!  (An incredibly close up of a pencil tip!!)  O.K. now that''s out of the way, what has this to do with the challenge?  Nice use of negative space.  6 Swash</td>', 'I finally figured out what this is!  (An incredibly close up of a pencil tip!!)  O.K. now that''s out of the way, what has this to do with the challenge?  Nice use of negative space.  6 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
