(184205, 10650, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. I see the silly figurines in and amongst the Wandering Jew, but that seems fairly "normal" to me.  (Yes, I''m strange!!!)  Overall, a bit dark, but the elf doesn''t look like he could stand it any brighter.  6 Swash</td>', 'O.K. I see the silly figurines in and amongst the Wandering Jew, but that seems fairly "normal" to me.  (Yes, I''m strange!!!)  Overall, a bit dark, but the elf doesn''t look like he could stand it any brighter.  6 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(184207, 10607, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m confused.  She (?) appears to be of northern european extraction, but the garb is more like middle eastern.  The blue eye is a dead give away.  So, is that the stranger part or were you really going with the title concept?  6 Swash</td>', 'Wow, I''m confused.  She (?) appears to be of northern european extraction, but the garb is more like middle eastern.  The blue eye is a dead give away.  So, is that the stranger part or were you really going with the title concept?  6 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(184210, 10551, 1005, '<td valign="top">Still confused.....the HCL is the out of place item, right?  Are you saying all these things give you heartburn (acid)?  Cropping seems awkward with the cutting off of several items partially.  Color is good and strong.  Focus also good, strong.  Challenge connection mild.  7 Swash</td>', 'Still confused.....the HCL is the out of place item, right?  Are you saying all these things give you heartburn (acid)?  Cropping seems awkward with the cutting off of several items partially.  Color is good and strong.  Focus also good, strong.  Challenge connection mild.  7 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(184214, 10402, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the edges seem strong, but somehow fuzzy.  Is this soft focus?  If so, why?   7 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo, the edges seem strong, but somehow fuzzy.  Is this soft focus?  If so, why?   7 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(184219, 10574, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, but isn''t this a bottled boilermaker?  (Challenge question)  Well taken, good framing, lighting, technically a fine shot.  7 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot, but isn''t this a bottled boilermaker?  (Challenge question)  Well taken, good framing, lighting, technically a fine shot.  7 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(184220, 10516, 3080, '<td valign="top">The colors looks a bit muddied here.  I wonder if the water always looks like that, and if a level adjustment could have made it look less muddy.  To show you what I''m talking about, I wanted to send you these links to a couple photos I''ve critiqued in the past.  I will say the same thing about your shot that I did the other, I think it would look better in black and white.  Here is a link to a color version of this shot... //www1.photosig.com/viewphoto.php?id=364242  and here is a link to a black and white... //www1.photosig.com/viewphoto.php?id=428152.<br/>Just wanted to share those with you.<br/>Also, I think your shot could use a slight rotation to the right.  Otherwise, very nice. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The colors looks a bit muddied here.  I wonder if the water always looks like that, and if a level adjustment could have made it look less muddy.  To show you what I''m talking about, I wanted to send you these links to a couple photos I''ve critiqued in the past.  I will say the same thing about your shot that I did the other, I think it would look better in black and white.  Here is a link to a color version of this shot... //www1.photosig.com/viewphoto.php?id=364242  and here is a link to a black and white... //www1.photosig.com/viewphoto.php?id=428152.Just wanted to share those with you.Also, I think your shot could use a slight rotation to the right.  Otherwise, very nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-06 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(184223, 10600, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good book!  Well taken photo.  I just don''t have the words to say what bugs me about this.  Oh well, how about a 7?  Swash</td>', 'Good book!  Well taken photo.  I just don''t have the words to say what bugs me about this.  Oh well, how about a 7?  Swash', '2003-01-06 19:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(184227, 10524, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes (except for the girl with the horizontal striped shirt/sweater).  While I get the idea, I don''t find it strange for fountains to be in the money mecca of the US.  There''s cash in them hotels/casinoes!  Of course they can afford to splash water in the desert.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice silhouettes (except for the girl with the horizontal striped shirt/sweater).  While I get the idea, I don''t find it strange for fountains to be in the money mecca of the US.  There''s cash in them hotels/casinoes!  Of course they can afford to splash water in the desert.  7 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(184229, 10489, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is an excelent photo.  I think it will be a 10 from me.  I love the angle and framing/cropping and the focus and clarity are great.  The detail shown in the boot is simply perfect.  The background is wonderful.  Great DOF and the sepia tones are great as well.  I think the best part though is the feeling of the photo.  It gives off a strong mood, and I like that.  We kind of lose the border in the grass area, but still excelent.  Great shot, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an excelent photo.  I think it will be a 10 from me.  I love the angle and framing/cropping and the focus and clarity are great.  The detail shown in the boot is simply perfect.  The background is wonderful.  Great DOF and the sepia tones are great as well.  I think the best part though is the feeling of the photo.  It gives off a strong mood, and I like that.  We kind of lose the border in the grass area, but still excelent.  Great shot, and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-06 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(184233, 10665, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I did something sort of similar.  You need to work on your props more ( the pedistal the man is standing on, the string not coming from the tip of the pole and the fish seems oddly hooked) and he needs to be much clearer (very hard, but do-able!)   Model needs to loose the recently worn clothing look and a more sky/mountains/trees background.  Skin color is very good.  7 Swash</td>', 'Great idea!  I did something sort of similar.  You need to work on your props more ( the pedistal the man is standing on, the string not coming from the tip of the pole and the fish seems oddly hooked) and he needs to be much clearer (very hard, but do-able!)   Model needs to loose the recently worn clothing look and a more sky/mountains/trees background.  Skin color is very good.  7 Swash', '2003-01-06 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(184234, 10627, 1005, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that!  Store lighting isn''t conductive to good photos, otherwise very clear, well taken photo.  (Joke: Recent sex change confusion?)<br/>7  Swash</td>', 'Been there, done that!  Store lighting isn''t conductive to good photos, otherwise very clear, well taken photo.  (Joke: Recent sex change confusion?)7  Swash', '2003-01-06 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(184235, 10694, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good, clear shot.  Great color.  Challenge met.  Score upgrade from 7 to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Very good, clear shot.  Great color.  Challenge met.  Score upgrade from 7 to 8.  Swash', '2003-01-06 19:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(184237, 10456, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the puppy and really like the photo but don''t like the dark blank on the right side all the way up.  Was this intentional?  Can''t believe he just laid there under all those animals.  Way to go.  PTL</td>', 'I love the puppy and really like the photo but don''t like the dark blank on the right side all the way up.  Was this intentional?  Can''t believe he just laid there under all those animals.  Way to go.  PTL', '2003-01-06 19:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(184242, 10627, 4411, '<td valign="top">OMG ... no! Nightmare! Not a ''great'' photo in any artistic sense of the word, but extremely funny. I would have cropped the right hand side where the aisle ends for a less distracting background.</td>', 'OMG ... no! Nightmare! Not a ''great'' photo in any artistic sense of the word, but extremely funny. I would have cropped the right hand side where the aisle ends for a less distracting background.', '2003-01-06 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(184247, 10596, 5312, '<td valign="top">Not real sure what this is representing, sorry.</td>', 'Not real sure what this is representing, sorry.', '2003-01-06 19:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(184248, 10607, 5312, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, good lighting.  The shadow or dark area to the bottom left corner appears distracting.  Not bad.</td>', 'Interesting idea, good lighting.  The shadow or dark area to the bottom left corner appears distracting.  Not bad.', '2003-01-06 19:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(184251, 10630, 5312, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  I don''t know why they are in a strange area.  Is this in a zoo?  From what I have seen these birds like muddy areas.  I would like to see this maybe a little clearer.</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  I don''t know why they are in a strange area.  Is this in a zoo?  From what I have seen these birds like muddy areas.  I would like to see this maybe a little clearer.', '2003-01-06 19:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(184256, 10617, 4411, '<td valign="top">A great idea, very funny. Good composition /cropping &amp; nicely lit, well done.</td>', 'A great idea, very funny. Good composition /cropping & nicely lit, well done.', '2003-01-06 19:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(184260, 10484, 4411, '<td valign="top">A bit of a push on the challenge as the flower really doesn''t look out of place!<br/>However it''s a lovely photo, you''ve put the flower in just the right part of the frame and the wet foliage provides a nice background. I like it, well done.</td>', 'A bit of a push on the challenge as the flower really doesn''t look out of place!However it''s a lovely photo, you''ve put the flower in just the right part of the frame and the wet foliage provides a nice background. I like it, well done.', '2003-01-06 20:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(184262, 10675, 4411, '<td valign="top">A good shot, and a very good idea for the challenge. I like the message, despite not being religious. Technically the photo is very good, though the trees get in the way a bit too much. Well done.</td>', 'A good shot, and a very good idea for the challenge. I like the message, despite not being religious. Technically the photo is very good, though the trees get in the way a bit too much. Well done.', '2003-01-06 20:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(184273, 10514, 4411, '<td valign="top">This seems too dark overall, yet too light in places - a tricky effect to achieve! I think the light needed softening, or bouncing to even it out across the scene a bit more.<br/>Not a bad shot, composition is good, and I like the angle you''ve shot it at.</td>', 'This seems too dark overall, yet too light in places - a tricky effect to achieve! I think the light needed softening, or bouncing to even it out across the scene a bit more.Not a bad shot, composition is good, and I like the angle you''ve shot it at.', '2003-01-06 20:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(184284, 10574, 4411, '<td valign="top">LOL. I can relate to this. Normally I give bonus points for using Jack Daniels but I''ve seen far too much of the stuff recently ; )<br/>I''m not sure about the positioning of the handle - it may have been better hidden (as well as it could be) behind the glass and if I''m being picky there''s some stray reflections.<br/>Having said that, I really do like the shot and the idea. Great work.</td>', 'LOL. I can relate to this. Normally I give bonus points for using Jack Daniels but I''ve seen far too much of the stuff recently ; )I''m not sure about the positioning of the handle - it may have been better hidden (as well as it could be) behind the glass and if I''m being picky there''s some stray reflections.Having said that, I really do like the shot and the idea. Great work.', '2003-01-06 20:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(184287, 10630, 4585, '<td valign="top">To me, tonality is off.  I like the shadows.  Good luck!</td>', 'To me, tonality is off.  I like the shadows.  Good luck!', '2003-01-06 20:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(184292, 10694, 4585, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I would have made it a fruit.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great concept.  I would have made it a fruit.  Good luck!', '2003-01-06 20:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(184293, 10545, 4411, '<td valign="top">Well the idea is different for sure!<br/>I like the overall colour on this ... very, um, blue. The light is a little harsh on the back of the paddling pool and the tissue box is a little too centred, but I like the shadow and the overall look. Well done.</td>', 'Well the idea is different for sure!I like the overall colour on this ... very, um, blue. The light is a little harsh on the back of the paddling pool and the tissue box is a little too centred, but I like the shadow and the overall look. Well done.', '2003-01-06 20:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(184296, 10456, 4585, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  Focus is too soft and a bit distracting!  Good luck!</td>', 'Great subject!  Focus is too soft and a bit distracting!  Good luck!', '2003-01-06 20:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(184297, 10491, 4585, '<td valign="top">Great use of colors and shapes!</td>', 'Great use of colors and shapes!', '2003-01-06 20:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(184301, 10402, 4585, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft and image is grainy.  Great subject though.  Good luck!</td>', 'Focus is soft and image is grainy.  Great subject though.  Good luck!', '2003-01-06 20:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(184304, 10494, 4585, '<td valign="top">Soft focus!....Focus kills ya in this place.  All else can be poor about an image on this site but not focus!  It will git ya every time.  Good luck!</td>', 'Soft focus!....Focus kills ya in this place.  All else can be poor about an image on this site but not focus!  It will git ya every time.  Good luck!', '2003-01-06 20:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
