(185030, 10575, 3599, '<td valign="top">Funny photo and title, I would have cropped some of the court out.  I don''t think it is necessary because the B-ball hoop already shows that these gulls are on a B-ball court.  I also would have tried to change the angle a little where the hoop isn''t as close to the middle as it is.</td>', 'Funny photo and title, I would have cropped some of the court out.  I don''t think it is necessary because the B-ball hoop already shows that these gulls are on a B-ball court.  I also would have tried to change the angle a little where the hoop isn''t as close to the middle as it is.', '2003-01-07 12:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(185033, 10670, 3599, '<td valign="top">I try not to base my judging on the border but I think in this instance the border is very distracting.  This is a great photo and I think a border is fine as long as it isn''t obtrusive.</td>', 'I try not to base my judging on the border but I think in this instance the border is very distracting.  This is a great photo and I think a border is fine as long as it isn''t obtrusive.', '2003-01-07 12:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(185034, 10607, 3599, '<td valign="top">I will take another look at this photo from another monitor but the focus seems a little on the soft side.  When taking pictures of people I tend to zoom in focus on their eye and then zoom out and set my shot.  I like the colors and mysterious look of the photo.  I think if it were possible, do this same shot in a 7-11 or McDonalds as opposed to a studio.  I am assuming that this photo was taken in the U.S.</td>', 'I will take another look at this photo from another monitor but the focus seems a little on the soft side.  When taking pictures of people I tend to zoom in focus on their eye and then zoom out and set my shot.  I like the colors and mysterious look of the photo.  I think if it were possible, do this same shot in a 7-11 or McDonalds as opposed to a studio.  I am assuming that this photo was taken in the U.S.', '2003-01-07 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
