(185787, 10624, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well set up.  Neat lighting, how did you do that part (blue)?  Neat use of mixed props.  Very good technically.  (I''m in a bad mood, but this is better than a 9, so up you go!)  10 Swash</td>', 'Well set up.  Neat lighting, how did you do that part (blue)?  Neat use of mixed props.  Very good technically.  (I''m in a bad mood, but this is better than a 9, so up you go!)  10 Swash', '2003-01-08 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(185788, 10670, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot.  The eyes on the side of the glass are killers!  Technically there are a few things about the set up that might get dings for, but as I think about them, they are pretty stupid.  The glass could have been cleaner or less scratched, can''t tell which.  The background below the glass could have been a tad less busy, but honestly those are pretty stupid when you really look at this shot.  The reflection along the glass is just wonderful, I can''t get over it. The reflected fins, the color of the goldfish, back to the eyes, wild eyes.  I had started this as a 9, cool shot, considered a 10, but I''ll nick you one point for the above trivial minus''s (plus the glare in the lower left corner).  Nice orange frame.<br/> <br/>9 Swash</td>', 'This is such a cool shot.  The eyes on the side of the glass are killers!  Technically there are a few things about the set up that might get dings for, but as I think about them, they are pretty stupid.  The glass could have been cleaner or less scratched, can''t tell which.  The background below the glass could have been a tad less busy, but honestly those are pretty stupid when you really look at this shot.  The reflection along the glass is just wonderful, I can''t get over it. The reflected fins, the color of the goldfish, back to the eyes, wild eyes.  I had started this as a 9, cool shot, considered a 10, but I''ll nick you one point for the above trivial minus''s (plus the glare in the lower left corner).  Nice orange frame. 9 Swash', '2003-01-08 12:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(185793, 10630, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot.  Reminds me of early Sci Fi movies that tried to depict strange new worlds with odd coloration.  Very cool.  I hope you are getting credit for a great concept.  9 Swash  (I''m in a really bad DPC mood, can you tell?)</td>', 'Really cool shot.  Reminds me of early Sci Fi movies that tried to depict strange new worlds with odd coloration.  Very cool.  I hope you are getting credit for a great concept.  9 Swash  (I''m in a really bad DPC mood, can you tell?)', '2003-01-08 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(185797, 10689, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really, really great shot of the cat.  It''s a really pretty cat (I like grey).  I just don''t see the challenge connection.  (Title not withstanding)  I really need something IN the photo that reflects the challenge, not just the title.  Sorry, it is a great cat shot!<br/>6 Swash</td>', 'Really, really great shot of the cat.  It''s a really pretty cat (I like grey).  I just don''t see the challenge connection.  (Title not withstanding)  I really need something IN the photo that reflects the challenge, not just the title.  Sorry, it is a great cat shot!6 Swash', '2003-01-08 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(185801, 10675, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast.  The building in the background is really bright, colorful, but your subject (IMO the church) is as dramatic, so attention is drawn away from it by the contrasting background.  You might try turning up the contrast more, it''s legal.   The trees seem on the dim side, too.  Good challenge shot.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice contrast.  The building in the background is really bright, colorful, but your subject (IMO the church) is as dramatic, so attention is drawn away from it by the contrasting background.  You might try turning up the contrast more, it''s legal.   The trees seem on the dim side, too.  Good challenge shot.  8 Swash', '2003-01-08 12:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
