(185942, 10456, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  I get the idea, but honestly, I had hoped for more out of this world strange-ness.  The shadow across the back and the glare on the gray and white thing in front are a bit difficult, but this is a photo of opporunity (or at least it looks that way), so I''m a little more forgiving.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cute shot!  I get the idea, but honestly, I had hoped for more out of this world strange-ness.  The shadow across the back and the glare on the gray and white thing in front are a bit difficult, but this is a photo of opporunity (or at least it looks that way), so I''m a little more forgiving.  8 Swash', '2003-01-08 16:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(185944, 10533, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, sort of like the game Risk.  Well taken photo, but as I have told just about everyone else, I was hoping for something more out of this world for this challenge, really really strange.  Still this is one of the better taken shots, so 8 it is!  Swash</td>', 'Neat idea, sort of like the game Risk.  Well taken photo, but as I have told just about everyone else, I was hoping for something more out of this world for this challenge, really really strange.  Still this is one of the better taken shots, so 8 it is!  Swash', '2003-01-08 16:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(185946, 10662, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice simple trick.  Well taken photo.  The diamond stud is about the right size for a seed, so this works well for me.  I was hoping for more out of this world strangeness from this challenge, but this does meet the challenge, so...8 Swash</td>', 'Nice simple trick.  Well taken photo.  The diamond stud is about the right size for a seed, so this works well for me.  I was hoping for more out of this world strangeness from this challenge, but this does meet the challenge, so...8 Swash', '2003-01-08 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(185949, 10615, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  Challenge well met.  Great color!!!  I had hoped this challenge would bring out more "out of this world" strangeness, but this will do.  A tad glarey on the blonde girl.   8 Swash</td>', 'Very good photo.  Challenge well met.  Great color!!!  I had hoped this challenge would bring out more "out of this world" strangeness, but this will do.  A tad glarey on the blonde girl.   8 Swash', '2003-01-08 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(186009, 10477, 772, '<td valign="top">Great shot.. I love the concept and the execution on this one.. = 10 - setzler</td>', 'Great shot.. I love the concept and the execution on this one.. = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-08 18:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(186037, 10614, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like this crop... This image works very well as a Panorama (I generally don''t like panos, but this one is nice).  Nice crisp clean details.  A more dramatic sky would be nice, but there isn''t much you can do about that, is there?  Good luck!</td>', 'I like this crop... This image works very well as a Panorama (I generally don''t like panos, but this one is nice).  Nice crisp clean details.  A more dramatic sky would be nice, but there isn''t much you can do about that, is there?  Good luck!', '2003-01-08 19:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(186040, 10690, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  One of the best effect shots in the challenge!  The color of the swimmer and water don''t seem quite right, but I won''t quibble too much!  Score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Swash</td>', 'Very cool!  One of the best effect shots in the challenge!  The color of the swimmer and water don''t seem quite right, but I won''t quibble too much!  Score upgrade from 8 to 9.  Swash', '2003-01-08 19:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(186041, 10494, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wierd, yes, that''s wierd all right, won''t catch me doing that!  Good capture of the motion and focus on the diver.  I was hoping for more out of this world strange-ness, but this is odd enough to qualify, so challenge met.  8 Swash</td>', 'Wierd, yes, that''s wierd all right, won''t catch me doing that!  Good capture of the motion and focus on the diver.  I was hoping for more out of this world strange-ness, but this is odd enough to qualify, so challenge met.  8 Swash', '2003-01-08 19:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(186042, 10491, 1005, '<td valign="top">An outcast!  Very good color and focus.  Nice arrangement, pleasing to the eyes.  I was hoping for more out of this world strangeness from this challenge, but this is a very, very nicely taken photo, so I won''t ding you too much for my hopes.  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'An outcast!  Very good color and focus.  Nice arrangement, pleasing to the eyes.  I was hoping for more out of this world strangeness from this challenge, but this is a very, very nicely taken photo, so I won''t ding you too much for my hopes.  8 Swash', '2003-01-08 19:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(186043, 10698, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo, I can read most of the Nutrition Facts.  A tad too bright on the right most two eggs, otherwise very nicely light.  I was hoping this challenge would net more out of this world strangeness, but this does meet the challenge.<br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Very clear photo, I can read most of the Nutrition Facts.  A tad too bright on the right most two eggs, otherwise very nicely light.  I was hoping this challenge would net more out of this world strangeness, but this does meet the challenge.8 Swash', '2003-01-08 19:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(186044, 10617, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken, silly shot.  Nice find with the tiny sea shells and chair.  Good use of alternate props for using the pine tree for dune grass, nearly fooled me.  Good lighting, no nasty glare spots.  Challenge met with a good degree of creativity.  I had initially scored this an 8, but it''s good enough to go 9 (score upgrade!).  Swash</td>', 'Well taken, silly shot.  Nice find with the tiny sea shells and chair.  Good use of alternate props for using the pine tree for dune grass, nearly fooled me.  Good lighting, no nasty glare spots.  Challenge met with a good degree of creativity.  I had initially scored this an 8, but it''s good enough to go 9 (score upgrade!).  Swash', '2003-01-08 19:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(186046, 10545, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo.  Strange....yes, but it could have been an accident, too.  I was hoping for more out of this world strange-ness from this challenge.  A little nasty glare on the pool side.  Still, it''s an 8, Swash</td>', 'Well taken photo.  Strange....yes, but it could have been an accident, too.  I was hoping for more out of this world strange-ness from this challenge.  A little nasty glare on the pool side.  Still, it''s an 8, Swash', '2003-01-08 19:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
