(186187, 10665, 4430, '<td valign="top">I think that you could have cropped more of the body out.</td>', 'I think that you could have cropped more of the body out.', '2003-01-09 00:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(186190, 10584, 6092, '<td valign="top">Very Cool Shot..</td>', 'Very Cool Shot..', '2003-01-09 00:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(186259, 10526, 5950, '<td valign="top">Very, very, very clever idea!</td>', 'Very, very, very clever idea!', '2003-01-09 07:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(186270, 10556, 5651, '<td valign="top">I can almost sympathize with how out of place it feels!<br/>I would have been tempted to crop the bottom and top of the photo. Good idea!</td>', 'I can almost sympathize with how out of place it feels!I would have been tempted to crop the bottom and top of the photo. Good idea!', '2003-01-09 08:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(186272, 10516, 5651, '<td valign="top">Good Photo, but he looks like he fits right in!</td>', 'Good Photo, but he looks like he fits right in!', '2003-01-09 08:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(186275, 10670, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is a surprisingly interesting image. It most certainly meats the challenge. On the photo, perfection would have been acheived IMHO if the flare on the lower left edge of the surrounding orange reflection could have been avoided, and of course the many white spots around the same area. I don''t believe the orange frame helps in any way; white would aliviate tension in the colour composition. All in all this is my favorourite this week.</td>', 'This is a surprisingly interesting image. It most certainly meats the challenge. On the photo, perfection would have been acheived IMHO if the flare on the lower left edge of the surrounding orange reflection could have been avoided, and of course the many white spots around the same area. I don''t believe the orange frame helps in any way; white would aliviate tension in the colour composition. All in all this is my favorourite this week.', '2003-01-09 09:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(186277, 10574, 2472, '<td valign="top">This one is technically perfect. No flares  or burned reflections on glass; dead on focus and atractive colour management. Although one type of alcohol is no real stranger to the other, it surely looks strange to me. Have you tried this with a black background? Great shot.</td>', 'This one is technically perfect. No flares  or burned reflections on glass; dead on focus and atractive colour management. Although one type of alcohol is no real stranger to the other, it surely looks strange to me. Have you tried this with a black background? Great shot.', '2003-01-09 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(186279, 10698, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is a good representation of the challenge, and it is technically flawless. IMHO it lacks creativity in aesthetics and composition. Did you try another angle, a more suggestive cropping, or a white background, so the dullness in colours is reduced?</td>', 'This is a good representation of the challenge, and it is technically flawless. IMHO it lacks creativity in aesthetics and composition. Did you try another angle, a more suggestive cropping, or a white background, so the dullness in colours is reduced?', '2003-01-09 09:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(186296, 10551, 4430, '<td valign="top">Is everything always perfectly lined up or did you do this for the pic?  I think cluttered would have actually been better.</td>', 'Is everything always perfectly lined up or did you do this for the pic?  I think cluttered would have actually been better.', '2003-01-09 10:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(186335, 10688, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice fog shot.  Good eerie feeling to it.  I get your challenge, but I was hoping for more "out of this world" type strange-ness.  (score unaffected) Very nice.<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Nice fog shot.  Good eerie feeling to it.  I get your challenge, but I was hoping for more "out of this world" type strange-ness.  (score unaffected) Very nice.7 Swash', '2003-01-09 12:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(186344, 10614, 811, '<td valign="top">the only thing i don''t like about this picture is that the sky is so "boring."  that said, though, since i am assuming you aren''t God, you can''t control that!  The spires give this a neat effect, and I love the crop.  Very well done.  10</td>', 'the only thing i don''t like about this picture is that the sky is so "boring."  that said, though, since i am assuming you aren''t God, you can''t control that!  The spires give this a neat effect, and I love the crop.  Very well done.  10', '2003-01-09 12:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(186345, 10690, 811, '<td valign="top">I think I know how you did this, but I can''t wait to see if I''m right!!!  Very nice colors, and a cool idea. 10</td>', 'I think I know how you did this, but I can''t wait to see if I''m right!!!  Very nice colors, and a cool idea. 10', '2003-01-09 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(186347, 10575, 811, '<td valign="top">the composition of this is busy to me, but I''m not sure how I could suggest to fix it.  As far as meeting the challenge, you nailed it, and made me laugh besides.  Great work.</td>', 'the composition of this is busy to me, but I''m not sure how I could suggest to fix it.  As far as meeting the challenge, you nailed it, and made me laugh besides.  Great work.', '2003-01-09 12:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(186348, 10489, 811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The elements combine (coloring, composition, subject, focus) and compell me to give you a 10.  Good work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The elements combine (coloring, composition, subject, focus) and compell me to give you a 10.  Good work.', '2003-01-09 12:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(186349, 10603, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute, very well taken shot.  I had hoped for more out of this world strange-ness from this challenge, but challenge met.  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute, very well taken shot.  I had hoped for more out of this world strange-ness from this challenge, but challenge met.  7 Swash', '2003-01-09 12:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(186351, 10459, 1005, '<td valign="top">Funny title.  Well taken shot.  No complaints, but I had hoped this challenge would bring more out of this world type strangeness.  7 Swash</td>', 'Funny title.  Well taken shot.  No complaints, but I had hoped this challenge would bring more out of this world type strangeness.  7 Swash', '2003-01-09 12:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(186353, 10615, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is almost too tight on this, but I can understand why you did it that way ( I think).  Excellent photography, and a good job at meeting the challenge!</td>', 'I think the crop is almost too tight on this, but I can understand why you did it that way ( I think).  Excellent photography, and a good job at meeting the challenge!', '2003-01-09 12:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(186354, 10627, 811, '<td valign="top">I chuckled for a LONG time after seeing this.  Photographically speaking, I think a tighter crop would have hleped, so that you couldn''t see down the rest of the aisle, but the humor element, and the creativity that you met the challenge with warrants you a 9, easy.  hahahahahahhahahah (still laughing)</td>', 'I chuckled for a LONG time after seeing this.  Photographically speaking, I think a tighter crop would have hleped, so that you couldn''t see down the rest of the aisle, but the humor element, and the creativity that you met the challenge with warrants you a 9, easy.  hahahahahahhahahah (still laughing)', '2003-01-09 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(186355, 10643, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken shot (well maybe a tad dark, but then the bournouse would be too bright, so pass on that)  I get your strange-ness, but I had hoped for more out of this world strange from this challenge.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very well taken shot (well maybe a tad dark, but then the bournouse would be too bright, so pass on that)  I get your strange-ness, but I had hoped for more out of this world strange from this challenge.  7 Swash', '2003-01-09 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(186358, 10596, 811, '<td valign="top">I think it would helped me if I could have seen more of the context that this was in.  Also, when photographing stuff like this, I think it helps to get a dramatic angle (lower perhaps, changing the perspective) or really nailing the details.  This seems just a little flat to me.</td>', 'I think it would helped me if I could have seen more of the context that this was in.  Also, when photographing stuff like this, I think it helps to get a dramatic angle (lower perhaps, changing the perspective) or really nailing the details.  This seems just a little flat to me.', '2003-01-09 13:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(186360, 10523, 811, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a "display" at Dollywood in Tn (used to be Silver Dollar city).  The focus seems kinda fuzzy in spots (were you using a tripod?) and the lights are almost a bit blown out.  A very interesting image, none the less</td>', 'This reminds me of a "display" at Dollywood in Tn (used to be Silver Dollar city).  The focus seems kinda fuzzy in spots (were you using a tripod?) and the lights are almost a bit blown out.  A very interesting image, none the less', '2003-01-09 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(186379, 10453, 4852, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and color . Lighting and angle emphasizes the subject matter.Shadows give depth to images and adds to the perspective. 8</td>', 'Great contrast and color . Lighting and angle emphasizes the subject matter.Shadows give depth to images and adds to the perspective. 8', '2003-01-09 14:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
