(186458, 10491, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is very well executed and composed. Light and focus are precise. Now from my personal stand point, Im already tired of fruits and vegetables, especially tomatoes. I am looking forward for creativity surprises, above and beyond technical achievement, which I consider a given trait for a submission to a challenge.</td>', 'This is very well executed and composed. Light and focus are precise. Now from my personal stand point, Im already tired of fruits and vegetables, especially tomatoes. I am looking forward for creativity surprises, above and beyond technical achievement, which I consider a given trait for a submission to a challenge.', '2003-01-09 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(186468, 10524, 772, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure on this photo... I really enjoy the silhouetted spectators at the bottom of the frame.  I also like the little bit of shrubery on the lower right edge of the frame... that seems to help upset the balance here nicely.  Great shot :) = 9 - setzler</td>', 'Perfect exposure on this photo... I really enjoy the silhouetted spectators at the bottom of the frame.  I also like the little bit of shrubery on the lower right edge of the frame... that seems to help upset the balance here nicely.  Great shot :) = 9 - setzler', '2003-01-09 16:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
