(186914, 10459, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is technically very well acheived, and the dry noodles are certainly strange, but IMHO the cork should have been left out of the composition, since it''s texture and color do not match atractively with the other 2 elements. I am also not very sure about the title, so perhaps the problem is that I am not understanding that the stranger is the cork...</td>', 'This is technically very well acheived, and the dry noodles are certainly strange, but IMHO the cork should have been left out of the composition, since it''s texture and color do not match atractively with the other 2 elements. I am also not very sure about the title, so perhaps the problem is that I am not understanding that the stranger is the cork...', '2003-01-10 13:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(186922, 10650, 2472, '<td valign="top">This complies very well with the challenge and is technically well executed. The focus is quite good. IMHO the composition is overcrowded, and the abundance of elements becomes too distracting. There are at least 6 of them in focus, not counting the complicated foliage background, and I think 2 would have been more than enough.</td>', 'This complies very well with the challenge and is technically well executed. The focus is quite good. IMHO the composition is overcrowded, and the abundance of elements becomes too distracting. There are at least 6 of them in focus, not counting the complicated foliage background, and I think 2 would have been more than enough.', '2003-01-10 13:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(186924, 10617, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is very creative, fun and well executed. It is very hard to iluminate shining metal without flares. The details in the composition are great, such as the sea shells. It reminds me of Sponge Bob Square Pants (don''t ask why). It seems you were the one chosen this week to provide the idea for next weeks challenge, which is humor, for which this image and title would have been perfect.</td>', 'This is very creative, fun and well executed. It is very hard to iluminate shining metal without flares. The details in the composition are great, such as the sea shells. It reminds me of Sponge Bob Square Pants (don''t ask why). It seems you were the one chosen this week to provide the idea for next weeks challenge, which is humor, for which this image and title would have been perfect.', '2003-01-10 13:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
