(187625, 10593, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this shot quite a bit, but I think you need a tad more depth of field to bring the first part of the word ''digital'' into focus.  I think that would have made this stronger and kept the film canister out of focus as well... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'I like this shot quite a bit, but I think you need a tad more depth of field to bring the first part of the word ''digital'' into focus.  I think that would have made this stronger and kept the film canister out of focus as well... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-01-12 17:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(187627, 10575, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot :)  I love the concept here.. I would have tossed them a ball :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot :)  I love the concept here.. I would have tossed them a ball :) - setzler', '2003-01-12 17:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
