(187710, 10616, 656, '<td valign="top">Great use of infra-red to give a really ''spooky'' image.   I think maybe that as in all good portraiture, it would be better to have less of a sharp sunlight/ shadow region on your face, so that it all registered but that is pretty minor.  Very effective picture. (8)</td>', 'Great use of infra-red to give a really ''spooky'' image.   I think maybe that as in all good portraiture, it would be better to have less of a sharp sunlight/ shadow region on your face, so that it all registered but that is pretty minor.  Very effective picture. (8)', '2003-01-12 18:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
