(188100, 10448, 674, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/>Good idea! But the focus is slightly off in the front and the colours dont pop enough for me, I think the cameras metering system has been fooled by all the white.</td>', 'Critique ClubGood idea! But the focus is slightly off in the front and the colours dont pop enough for me, I think the cameras metering system has been fooled by all the white.', '2003-01-13 00:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(188135, 10670, 2003, '<td valign="top">too bad i didn''t take that bet, Anachronite!  I bought a $0.25 fish and put him (her?) in a martini glass, intending to shoot it from the side - the refraction in the glass made most of the pics come out way too distorted and i was at the point of giving up - but when i walked back over to the glass, i saw that from above the element of the glass that refracted from the side REFLECTED from above - i took 3 shots be fore i got this one, which is 98% perfect (points off for the glare and the dust) --- looks like most people were disturbed by the frame :(</td>', 'too bad i didn''t take that bet, Anachronite!  I bought a $0.25 fish and put him (her?) in a martini glass, intending to shoot it from the side - the refraction in the glass made most of the pics come out way too distorted and i was at the point of giving up - but when i walked back over to the glass, i saw that from above the element of the glass that refracted from the side REFLECTED from above - i took 3 shots be fore i got this one, which is 98% perfect (points off for the glare and the dust) --- looks like most people were disturbed by the frame :(', '2003-01-13 00:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
